From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juan Sanchez Fuentes <juanesf91@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Jul 2025 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: add HiFi4 DSP boot driver for T527/A523

Add U-Boot driver to boot the Xtensa HiFi4 DSP on Allwinner T527/A523
SoCs. The driver configures clocks and resets via the MCU CCU, loads
FreeRTOS firmware into DRAM, and releases the DSP from stall.

Register definitions derived from the BSP kernel device tree
(sun55i-t527.dtsi) and Linux MCU CCU driver (ccu-sun55i-a523-mcu.c).

Key T527 differences from sun8iw20:
- AArch64 with 64-bit physical addresses
- DSP CFG registers at 0x07100000 (vs 0x01700000)
- MCU CCU at 0x07102000 for clock gating and resets
- SRAM remap flag at 0x07010364
- No DRAM address remapping

Signed-off-by: Juan Sanchez Fuentes <juanesf91@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: opencode:deepseek-v4-flash-free
---

